  "evidencia": "Page: Ken Kwapis. Sentence: Kenneth William \"Ken\" Kwapis (born August 17, 1957) is an American film and television director and screenwriter.\nPage: Ken Kwapis. Sentence: He specialized in the single-camera sitcom in the 1990s and 2000s and has directed feature films such as \"Sesame Street Presents Follow That Bird\" (1985), \"The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants\" (2005), and \"He's Just Not That into You\" (2009).\nPage: John Woo. Sentence: Woo has directed several notable Hong Kong action films, among them, \"A Better Tomorrow\" (1986), \"The Killer\" (1989), \"Hard Boiled\" (1992), and \"Red Cliff\" (2008/2009).",
